| 1 | Version rollback requires persistent storage but Claude Projects have no cross-session persistence | Rollback feature silently fails after session ends | Does version history persist in a database/file, or is it session-only? |
| 2 | "GitHub push with each generation" (section 9) — no GitHub integration is described | QC assumes automatic commit, but nothing is actually saved | Is GitHub integration a separate tool/script outside the Claude skill, or is it planned? |
| 3 | Retry mechanism references "30-second timeout" and "5s delay between retries" — Claude cannot self-retry | Retry never actually occurs; QC assumes resilience that doesn't exist | Is the retry logic in a wrapper application? If so, where is that documented? |
